HST Office: the Slides ribbon animation gallery and undoable shape-effect replacement.

.uno:HstApplyAnimation?Effect:string=<preset id> replaces main-sequence effects of selected
shapes in normal view. None removes them. A single UndoAnimation precedes all changes;
state is the first effect id, None, or empty for mixed selections. The fixed gallery uses
translated preset labels, accessible class names, paging, and the Custom Animation deck.
SlidesEffectGalleries hides the item. S5 owns its placement on the Animations tab.

Apply after hst-slides-transition-gallery-strings.patch. Validation: the animation and
transition gallery Python unit tests; S6 builds and runs check-slides-animation-gallery.py.

